OL,3,GNEWSASprinter becomes mayor for a day
OL,4,Aafter joke comment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA champion sprinter has had the "insane
OL,7,Fexperience" of becoming mayor for the
OL,8,Fday after a tongue-in-cheek comment.
OL,10,FWhen Matt Hudson-Smith won his historic
OL,11,F400m gold in front of a home crowd at
OL,12,Fthe European Championships in
OL,13,FBirmingham in August, he joked: "I'm
OL,14,Fgoing to go for Mayor of Birmingham and
OL,15,FWolverhampton!"
OL,17,FAnd now his wish has come true - with
OL,18,Fcity leaders handing him
OL,19,FWolverhampton's mayoral chain of office
OL,20,Fand giving him the ceremonial role for
OL,21,Fa day.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
