OL,3,GNEWSASprinter becomes mayor for a day
OL,4,Aafter joke comment
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is an insane experience and
OL,7,Flearning the history about
OL,8,FWolverhampton and just being here as a
OL,9,Fwhole is something I'm not taking for
OL,10,Fgranted," said the 31-year-old.
